# Choice dialogues of the storyline payoff scenes (T-143). Compiled to zz_fs_storyline_scenes.json.

dialogue story.pie.talk
n0 marcus: One slice of my pie. Her door. Don't say who sent it. If she asks, say a stranger with excellent taste.
  next n1
n1 marcus: What do you say?
  ? Deliver it honestly. => r0 | flag:choice.pie.honest
  ? Improve it first. => r1 | flag:choice.pie.improve
  ? Eat it. => r2 | flag:choice.pie.eat
r0 -: You carry the slice to Odalys's door. She reads the note, sighs, and takes a bite.
  next r0b
r0b odalys: Ambitious. ...It's rather good. Tell him nothing.
  expr thinking
r1 -: You add a pinch of cinnamon on the way. Odalys takes a bite and frowns for a long time.
  next r1b
r1b odalys: Who touched this? It's better. I hate that.
  expr embarrassed
r2 -: You eat the slice on the road. It is excellent. You now have two angry customers.
  next r2b
r2b odalys: Marcus owes me an apology. And a pie. And, apparently, you.

dialogue story.notes.dorian
n0 -: You catch Dorian slipping a folded note under a door. Neither of you moves.
  next n1
n1 dorian: ...Well. Now you know.
  ? Say nothing. Just smile. => r0 | flag:choice.notes.dorian.smile
  ? Say thank you. => r1 | flag:choice.notes.dorian.thanks | friend:dorian,10
  ? Leave a note back. => r2 | flag:choice.notes.dorian.note | friend:dorian,15
r0 dorian: ...You smiled. That's a lot of kindness for one smile.
  expr embarrassed
r1 dorian: Oh. Thank you. That's the whole reward. I'll go and be flustered somewhere.
  expr happy
r2 dorian: A note, for me? ...I'm keeping it. In a drawer I've just invented.
  expr happy

